## 1. Acceptance
By enabling any feature behind the `mesh`, `data-commons`, or `enterprise` feature gates, or by configuring these features as `enabled` in your configuration, you agree to these terms.

## 2. Usage Tiers

### 2.1 Individual & Open Source Use
- Use of Mesh features is free for individuals and verified open-source projects.
- "Individual" is defined as a single person not acting on behalf of a commercial entity.

### 2.2 Commercial Use
- Organizations using Xavier Mesh features for commercial purposes require a Commercial License if they exceed any of the following thresholds:
