  - More than 50 employees.
- For commercial terms and pricing, see `docs/PRICING.md` or contact `iberi22`.

## 3. Network Participation
- Your node becomes part of the Xavier Mesh network.
- Node identity is derived from an Ed25519 keypair.
- You may opt in or out of Data Commons telemetry at any time.

## 4. Governance Rights
- Active nodes earn voting rights proportional to XP + reputation + activity.
- Voting is anonymous, non-delegable, and requires activity in the last 7 days.
- The Xavier Core Council retains veto power over security-critical proposals (66% vote).

## 5. XP Tokenomics
- XP tokens are earned through contribution to the mesh (telemetry, validation, sync).
- XP can be staked, spent, or transferred within the network.
- XP has no monetary value and is non-redeemable for fiat currency.

## 6. Data Sovereignty
- Your data remains your own and is encrypted at rest.
- Data Commons sharing is opt-in with granular consent levels.
- You may revoke consent at any time.

## 7. Termination
- You may exit the mesh at any time by disabling mesh features.
- XP balance is preserved locally but becomes non-transferable.
- Governance rights cease upon exit.

